# `.github/` is deliberately NOT excluded here. `src/init/scaffold/templates.rs` embeds
# `.github/templates/cutver/RELEASE.md` with `include_str!`, so that file is a compile-time input of
# the builder stage. Excluding the whole directory broke three consecutive releases (#258).
# The `!` line below is belt and braces, not the mechanism: a negation nested under an excluded
# parent directory is not something to rely on.
*.md
!.github/templates/cutver/RELEASE.md
target/
.git/
odd/
.idea/
.vscode/
